Subject: [PATCH] stage 280: the return path moves in as an observer

282 gave the mind a probe action and it did not pay for its place. On the
same tape the mind that never probes scores 0.704 held-out against 0.594
for the mind that does, and both arms that probed carried a tie-breaking
rule that measurably cost the teacher. The action goes.

The question it asked does not. Today an answer is a slot index, so
G_answer_is_slot proves the answer came off the tape; when the answer
stops being an index that proof disappears and the only label-free
replacement is to ask the tape about the value and see whether some other
mention carries the subject and the value together. So the check lives
here now, computed after the policy has answered, invisible to the policy
and absent from the reward - reported as return_path_when_correct against
return_path_when_wrong, since a check worth building on has to separate
those two before anything depends on it. Verified on a hand-built tape
where the right value has a second mention and the wrong ones do not.

It costs nothing during training: the diagnostic runs on the evaluation
pass only.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
